---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Anping Wire Mesh: China's Wire Mesh Manufacturing Hub";
const description = "Anping County produces 80% of China's wire mesh. Learn about its industrial clusters, product specializations, quality tiers, and how to source effectively.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Anping Wire Mesh: China's Manufacturing Hub</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl">
        Anping County in Hebei Province produces an estimated 80% of China's wire mesh.
        Understanding its industrial structure helps you source more effectively.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-amber-500">Home</a> / Anping Wire Mesh
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Why Anping Dominates Wire Mesh</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Anping's wire mesh industry dates to the Ming Dynasty, when local craftsmen wove silk
        for military use. Modern industrial production began in the 1950s and expanded
        dramatically after China's reform era. Today the county hosts thousands of registered
        wire mesh manufacturers, ranging from small workshops to large export-oriented factories.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        The concentration creates several advantages for buyers:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Complete supply chain</strong> — Wire drawing, weaving, welding, galvanizing, and PVC coating all happen locally</li>
        <li><strong>Competitive pricing</strong> — Intense local competition keeps margins thin</li>
        <li><strong>Product variety</strong> — From 5-micron filter mesh to heavy mining screens</li>
        <li><strong>Export infrastructure</strong> — Many factories have 10+ years of export experience</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Industrial Zones -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Key Industrial Zones</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Anping's wire mesh production is concentrated in several townships, each with
        different specializations:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Area</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Specialization</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Factory Type</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Anping Town (county seat)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Woven wire mesh, filter mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Medium to large manufacturers</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Taocheng Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Welded wire mesh, fence panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Mixed sizes, export-focused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Hebin Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Galvanized wire, barbed wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Wire drawing specialists</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Mazhuang Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Gabion baskets, hexagonal mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Heavy mesh fabricators</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Industrial Development Zone</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">High-end stainless steel mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Larger, certified factories</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product Specialization Map -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Product Specializations</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Different areas of Anping excel at different products. Matching your needs to the
        right specialization improves quality and pricing:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Woven Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Traditional strength. Factories here produce everything from coarse 2-mesh
            screens to ultra-fine 500-mesh filter cloth. Stainless steel and brass are
            common materials.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Welded Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Post-weld galvanizing and PVC coating lines are concentrated in specific
            workshops. Quality varies significantly—visit or audit before large orders.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Fence Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Complete production chains for 3D fence panels, chain link, and palisade fences.
            Accessories (posts, clamps, gates) often sourced from adjacent workshops.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Gabions & Geotextiles</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Heavy hexagonal mesh weaving and gabion assembly. Some factories offer
            design assistance for retaining wall projects.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Quality Tiers -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Quality Tiers</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Anping factories cluster into distinct quality tiers. Knowing which tier you need
        prevents both overpaying and quality disasters:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Tier</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Characteristics</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Best For</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Workshop</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">5-20 workers, basic equipment, limited QC</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Simple products, price-sensitive orders</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Small Factory</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">20-50 workers, some automation, basic testing</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Standard products, small to medium volumes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Medium Factory</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">50-200 workers, modern lines, full QC department</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Export orders, consistent quality requirements</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Large Manufacturer</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">200+ workers, ISO certification, R&D capability</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Technical products, long-term contracts, OEM</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded p-4 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-amber-800">
          <strong>Practical note:</strong> Many trading companies in Anping present themselves
          as factories. They're not necessarily bad—good traders add value through QC and
          logistics—but know what you're paying for. Ask for factory registration documents
          and production line photos if direct factory pricing matters to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sourcing Tips -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Sourcing from Anping: Practical Tips</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Visit during production</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            If possible, visit during (not before) production for your order. This shows
            actual capacity and QC processes. Many buyers schedule visits during
            wire drawing or weaving of their batch.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Specify tolerances explicitly</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            "Standard quality" means different things to different factories. Always specify
            wire diameter tolerance (±0.01mm for precision mesh, ±0.05mm for industrial),
            mesh count tolerance, and acceptable defect rates in writing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Test before shipping</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            For critical applications, arrange third-party inspection (SGS, BV, or local
            inspectors). For repeat orders, consider keeping a reference sample from
            an approved batch for comparison.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Understand pricing factors</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Anping pricing is competitive but not uniform. Key variables: wire cost
            (fluctuates with steel prices), zinc coating thickness, weaving complexity,
            and order size. Our <a href="/wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-amber-600 hover:underline">weight calculator</a> helps
            you verify material costs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Continue Exploring</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/wire-mesh-hebei/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Hebei Wire Mesh Overview</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Anping in context of Hebei's broader wire mesh industry</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Stainless Steel Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Technical specifications and sourcing guide</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Sourcing Guide</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Step-by-step procurement process</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/factory-directory/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Factory Directory</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Browse verified manufacturers</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Need Help Sourcing from Anping?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">Send your specifications. We'll connect you with suitable manufacturers.</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-900 font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        Send Inquiry
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
